{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: The Scream</strong>\u00a0is a cooperative horror game for 1-4 players, where you can play as a single player, but what could be better than hearing your friend scream in the game? This is an unforgettable experience you will get with your friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High difficulty of the game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Few hints</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stealth</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Proximity voice chat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate level design</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life to live</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive AI</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI hears most of the game sounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And much more</strong> <br><strong> </strong>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Caution</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is unique compared to many others that focus on the backrooms concept. It sets itself apart by not simply copying everything detailed within the community. Instead, it carefully integrates specific elements of the backrooms, providing a distinct perspective rather than mirroring the entire concept.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592490?t=1754733893","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3592490?t=1754733893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592490/865c78f010d2c11df32757df3cd9514d32ccbdd2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754733893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3592490/865c78f010d2c11df32757df3cd9514d32ccbdd2/capsule_18